stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ACTIVE
  ACTIVE --> KILLED: trigger(reason) / listeners pull quotes, cancel orders, cancel hedge parents; send KillSwitch
  KILLED --> KILLED: trigger / counted only
  KILLED --> RESET_PENDING: requestReset(operator)
  RESET_PENDING --> RESET_PENDING: approveReset by the same person, or inputs unhealthy / refused
  RESET_PENDING --> ACTIVE: approveReset(second person) and inputs healthy
  RESET_PENDING --> KILLED: trigger(reason) / full kill, KillSwitch sent
  note right of KILLED
    Risk engine refuses every quote and order
    (REJECT_KILLED) unless the state is ACTIVE.
    Post-trade daily-loss breach triggers with
    reason LimitBreach when configured.
  end note
